#. ja: どこへ移動しますか？
#. de: Wohin möchtest du reisen?
#. fr: Choisissez une destination.
msgctxt "custom/004/CtsErkEureka1Transpoint_00473:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA1TRANSPOINT_00473_MENUTITLE:1"
msgid "Select a destination."
msgstr "Выберите пункт назначения."

#. ja: <sheet PlaceName "<sheet EurekaAethernet $n1 0>" 0>
#. de: <sheet PlaceName "<sheet EurekaAethernet $n1 0>" 0>
#. fr: <sheet PlaceName "<sheet EurekaAethernet $n1 0>" 0>
#. macro: <title-case><noun-en PlaceName 2 "<sheet EurekaAethernet $n1 0>" 2 1></title-case> — the content with every word capitalized (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en PlaceName 2 "<sheet EurekaAethernet $n1 0>" 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = PlaceName, form = 2, row = text with macros, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <sheet EurekaAethernet $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = EurekaAethernet, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
